Testing the definition of Sum given in 

General Purpose Macrogenerator
by C. Strachey
CJ Vol.8 No.3, Oct 1965

Modified to run under bgpm by Martin Richards 2013

This version corrects the bug in Successor as defined
in Strachey's paper.

{Successor 3 4} => 3 5
{Successor 3 9} => 4 0

{Sum 3 4 2} => 3 6
{Sum 3 8 3} => 4 1



